# What `docker build` doesn't send to the builder: only pyproject.toml, uv.lock, src/, config/ and migrations/ are
# used. Keeping the rest out makes builds faster and keeps .env and model files out of any image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!config/
!migrations/
**/__pycache__
src/measure_*.py
src/judge_cases.py
src/quantize_classifier.py
